  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2A of DEC Ukraine Humanitarian Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict affected older women and men, including those with disabilities, are able to meet their needs through community response grants implemented by local organisations</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-affected, internally displaced men, women of all ages, boys and girls, with and without disabilities have increased access to food</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflicted affected older men and women with and without disabilities meet their basic right to protection through provision of cash for protection</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflicted affected older women and men, with and without disabilities, are able to meet their basic winter needs in a dignified and safe manner</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to meet the basic needs and improve the well-being of conflicted affected older Ukrainian men and women with and without disabilities</narrative>
  </description>
